<!-- 03 — AI ASSISTANTS -->
<section class="container measure section-block">
  <p class="label reveal" style="margin-bottom:1rem;">03 — Being found</p>
  <h2 class="display-md reveal reveal-delay-1" style="margin-bottom:1.25rem;">Readable for AI assistants too</h2>
  <p class="body-lg reveal reveal-delay-2" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">More and more research no longer starts in a search engine but with a question to an AI assistant. It recommends suppliers without linking to them — and only those whose website it can clearly understand.</p>
  <p class="body-lg reveal reveal-delay-2" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">That takes no tricks, just clarity: who the company is, what it offers, for whom and with what evidence — in a form that machines can read as well as people. Today this is part of the website, not a later project.</p>
</section>

